      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create aggregate_metric_stats.py in the current working directory.\nTask: retrieves aggregated statistics for a metric over a time window.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bda73a640015bxujeh8cz6bZ1",
